    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prom-connect" },
      "description": "Cumulative total of IEC 104 records received from the field device (blue) vs records durably written to the Kafka topic (green). If the two lines overlap, no data has been lost. A persistent gap between them means the connector received data that was never written to Kafka.",
