      "description": "Average and maximum number of IEC 104 records bundled into a single Kafka write batch. Larger batches indicate more efficient throughput. Very small batches (near 1) suggest low-frequency or bursty IEC 104 traffic. The max line reveals burst peaks and helps right-size buffer configuration.",
